{
 "title": "填空分类题库",
 "html": "<div>\n  <div>\n    <h1>程序填空分类题库</h1>\n    <div>\n      <span><span>所属模块</span> 初赛深化</span><span><span>题型</span> 程序填空</span><span><span>出题类型</span> 拉分大题</span><span><span>难度</span> <span>★★★★☆</span></span><span><span>必练指数</span> ★★★★★</span>    </div>\n\n    <h2 id=\"concept\">基础概念</h2>\n    <div><div><span>基</span>通俗讲解</div><p>程序填空题给出\"半成品\"代码，要求补全空缺处。熟悉<strong>常见补全模式</strong>能大幅提高速度：递推/DP、贪心、模拟、搜索四类套路最频出。本题按模式分类训练。</p></div>\n    <h2 id=\"dp\">模式一：递推 / DP</h2>\n    <div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：求第 n 项斐波那契（迭代）</span></div><div><p>状态转移。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int a=1,b=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=3;i&lt;=n;i++){ int c=___; a=b; b=c; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>// 答：a+b</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：c = a+b（滚动更新，下一项等于前两项之和）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：0/1 背包（倒序更新）</span></div><div><p>背包核心。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=m;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  for(int j=V; j&gt;=w[i]; j--)</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>    f[j] = max(f[j], ___);</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>// 答：f[j-w[i]]+v[i]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：f[j-w[i]]+v[i]（选第 i 件时从 f[j-w[i]] 转移，倒序防重复选）。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"greedy\">模式二：贪心</h2>\n    <div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：区间选最多不重叠（按右端点排序后贪心）</span></div><div><p>贪心策略。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>sort(a,a+n,[](Seg x,Seg y){return x.r&lt;y.r;});</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>int last=-1, ans=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  if(a[i].l &gt;= last){ ans++; ___; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>// 答：last=a[i].r</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：last=a[i].r（选当前区间后，更新已选区间的最右端，保证不重叠）。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"sim\">模式三：模拟</h2>\n    <div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：按题意逐字符处理字符串</span></div><div><p>模拟套路。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;s.length();i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  if(___) cnt++;   // 统计某类字符</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>// 答：s[i]==目标字符</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：条件填 s[i]==目标字符（或满足题意的判断）；模拟题关键是\"照做不跳步\"。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"more\">模式四~六：搜索 / 二分 / 并查集</h2>\n    <div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：DFS 遍历（防重复访问）</span></div><div><p>搜索套路。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>void dfs(int u){</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  vis[u]=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  for(int v:g[u]) if(___) dfs(v);</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>// 答：!vis[v]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>!vis[v]</code>（未访问才递归，防死循环与重复计数）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：二分找第一个 ≥ x 的位置</span></div><div><p>二分边界。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int l=0,r=n;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(l&lt;r){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  int m=l+(r-l)/2;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  if(a[m]&gt;=x) ___; else l=m+1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>// 答：r=m</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>r=m</code>（满足 a[m]>=x 时收缩右界，循环结束 l==r 为下界）。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：并查集 find（路径压缩）</span></div><div><p>连通块核心。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int find(int x){</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  if(fa[x]!=x) fa[x]=___;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  return fa[x];</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>// 答：find(fa[x])</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>find(fa[x])</code>（递归找根并压缩路径，把整条链直接挂到根，加速后续查询）。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"more2\">模式七~十二：高频进阶</h2>\n    <div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：前缀和递推</span></div><div><p>区间和 O(1) 查询。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int s[N]={0};</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) s[i]=___;   // 答：s[i-1]+a[i]</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>cout &lt;&lt; s[r]-s[l-1];</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>s[i-1]+a[i]</code>（前缀和递推；区间和 = s[r]-s[l-1]）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：差分数组区间加</span></div><div><p>区间统一加 v。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) d[i]=a[i]-a[i-1];</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>d[l]+=v; ___;   // 答：d[r+1]-=v</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>// 还原：a[i]=a[i-1]+d[i]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>d[r+1]-=v</code>（差分区间加只改两端，最后前缀和还原）。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：单调栈求下一个更大元素</span></div><div><p>Next Greater。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>stack&lt;int&gt; st;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  while(!st.empty() &amp;&amp; a[i]&gt;a[st.top()]){ ng[st.top()]=___; st.pop(); }</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  st.push(i);</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>a[i]</code>（栈顶遇到更大值，其下一个更大元素就是 a[i]）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：双指针（两数之和）</span></div><div><p>有序数组找和为 x 的一对。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int i=0,j=n-1;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(i&lt;j){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  if(a[i]+a[j]==x){ i++; j--; }</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  else if(a[i]+a[j]&lt;x) ___;   // 答：i++</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>  else j--;</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>i++</code>（和偏小则左指针右移增大）。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：快速排序 partition 归位</span></div><div><p>基准归位到分界点。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int p=arr[l], i=l, j=r;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(i&lt;j){ while(i&lt;j&amp;&amp;arr[j]&gt;=p)j--; while(i&lt;j&amp;&amp;arr[i]&lt;=p)i++; swap(arr[i],arr[j]); }</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>swap(arr[l], ___); return i;   // 答：arr[i]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>arr[i]</code>（把基准换到最终分界位置 i，返回 i 继续划分）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：拓扑排序入队</span></div><div><p>Kahn 算法。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=1;i&lt;=n;i++) if(ind[i]==0) q.push(i);</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>while(!q.empty()){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  int u=q.front(); q.pop();</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  for(int v:g[u]) if(--ind[v]==0) ___;   // 答：q.push(v)</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>q.push(v)</code>（入度降为 0 才可进入拓扑序）。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：记忆化搜索</span></div><div><p>避免重复计算。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int f(int n){</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  if(n&lt;=1) return n;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  if(dp[n]!=-1) return dp[n];</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  return dp[n]=___;   // 答：f(n-1)+f(n-2)</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>f(n-1)+f(n-2)</code>（先查缓存，未算则递归并存入）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：埃氏筛标记合数</span></div><div><p>筛出素数。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>for(int i=2;i*i&lt;=n;i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  if(!is[i])</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>    for(int j=i*i;j&lt;=n;j+=i) ___;   // 答：is[j]=1</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>is[j]=1</code>（从 i² 起标记 i 的倍数为合数）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：二分答案（最小可行）</span></div><div><p>求最小可行解。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>while(l&lt;r){</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  int m=(l+r)/2;</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  if(check(m)) r=m;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  else ___;   // 答：l=m+1</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>return l;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>l=m+1</code>（check 不成立说明 m 太小，左界右移）。</div></div><div><div><span>基础</span><span>补全：统计数字字符个数</span></div><div><p>字符串遍历。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>string s; cin&gt;&gt;s; int c=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;s.length();i++)</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  if(s[i]&gt;=&#039;0&#039; &amp;&amp; s[i]&lt;=&#039;9&#039;) ___;   // 答：c++</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>cout&lt;&lt;c;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>c++</code>（满足条件则计数，注意字符字面量用单引号）。</div></div><div><div><span>压轴</span><span>补全：滑动窗口定长最大和</span></div><div><p>窗口长度 k。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int sum=0, mx=0;</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>for(int i=0;i&lt;n;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  sum+=a[i];</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>  if(i&gt;=k) sum-=a[i-k];</span></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><span>  mx=max(mx, ___);   // 答：sum</span></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>sum</code>（维护窗口和，实时更新最大值）。</div></div><div><div><span>中档</span><span>补全：欧几里得求 gcd</span></div><div><p>辗转相除。</p><div><div><span>C++</span></div><div><table><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td><span>int g(int a,int b){</span></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><span>  while(b){ int t=a%b; a=b; ___; }   // 答：b=t</span></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><span>  return a;</span></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><span>}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div><span>▍解析：</span>答：<code>b=t</code>（每步用余数替换，直到 b 为 0）。</div></div>\n    <h2 id=\"tip\">高分技巧</h2>\n    <div><div><span>技</span>速算捷径</div><p>填空前先读完整段，<strong>推断函数整体意图</strong>再填局部；注意循环方向（背包倒序、前缀正序）、边界初值、返回值。多练本题库形成\"模式直觉\"。</p></div>\n    <h2 id=\"mnemonic\">记忆口诀</h2>\n    <div><div><span>技</span>📌 口诀</div><p><b>\"填空先猜整段意，四种模式记心里；背包倒序前缀正，边界初值要留意。\"</b></p></div>  </div>\n    <div>\n    <div id=\"toc\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div><h2 id=\"quiz\">📝 本节自测<span>共 6 题</span></h2><p>做完点「提交本节自测」即时判分；单选 / 多选 / 填空混合，答错可一键收入错题本。</p><div id=\"selfQuizBox\"><div><div>程序填空若空在递归边界，通常填？ <span>易</span></div><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_flb1\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>递归终止条件（return 基例）</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_flb1\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>随机值</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_flb1\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>注释</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"quiz_flb1\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>死循环</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>A</b></div><div>递归边界 = 基例。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>填空涉及“累加答案”，常见写法 ans ____ x（填运算符）。 <span>填空题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"输入答案（如 8 / 八）\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>+=</b></div><div>累加用 +=。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>程序填空常考类型有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>难</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_flb3[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>循环边界与步长</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_flb3[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>递归基例</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_flb3[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>数组下标计算</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_flb3[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>网页样式</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>网页样式无关。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>关于初赛，正确的认识有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>难</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>选择题错选会倒扣分数</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>阅读程序分值高需重点练</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>带计算器进考场更高效</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr16[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>复赛才考编程，初赛不考</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABD</b></div><div>错选倒扣、阅读程序占比高都是事实；<b>计算器通常不允许</b>，复赛才动手编程。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>阅读程序写结果题，常用的分析方法有？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"0\"><span>A</span><span>列变量追踪表</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"1\"><span>B</span><span>手算小样例验证</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"2\"><span>C</span><span>数学归纳找规律</span></label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr7[]\" value=\"3\"><span>D</span><span>凭感觉乱猜</span></label></div><div><span></span></div><div hidden><div>✅ 正确答案：<b>ABC</b></div><div>追踪表 + 小样例 + 归纳规律是稳妥三板斧。</div><div></div></div></div><div><div>下列哪些属于 CSP 初赛三大题型？（多选） <span>多选题</span> <span>中</span></div><div><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"quiz_ppr10[]\" value=\